        "TileImage": "$($repository bef5d5db-b64b-4a12-8d1a-681cf76cd135).Image",
        "Description": "We&apos;ve not got much time to explain. One of our spies, Indra Konda, has gone rogue. We have undeniable proof of him leaking classified information to our... adversaries. He&apos;s stationed at a resort that we&apos;re sending you on as well, and his patrol is quite isolated. There are many ways to go about this. You can follow the optional suggestions for the elimination, or you may use your own discretion. We can&apos;t afford the attention from clean-up, so avoid civilian casualties. Good luck.",
